.godot/*
# Tracked on purpose: the global class list (class_name scripts). A checkout
# that runs the game headless without importing first (e.g. an external self-
# check) otherwise parses every user of a new class_name as unknown (#274/#275).
!.godot/global_script_class_cache.cfg
build/
*.exe
GodotEngine/
prompt.md

# tools/ship_assets.py is a dev-only regeneration helper (it reads the
# original Soldat asset packs to rebuild assets/{scenery,textures}). The
# shipped scenery + terrain textures are COMMITTED here so a fresh clone
# renders correctly without running it.

# Local audit / scratch files
*_prompt.md
claude_*.log

# Python bytecode from tools/*.py
__pycache__/
